---
---

<div class="engineering-pillars bento-card">
  <div class="pillars-header">
    <div class="section-label">
      <i class="fas fa-layer-group" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <span>Piliers d'Ingénierie Logicielle</span>
    </div>
    <h3 class="pillars-title">Architecture, Systèmes &amp; Résilience</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="pillars-grid">
    <div class="pillar-item pillar-amber">
      <div class="pillar-icon">
        <i class="fas fa-bolt" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-content">
        <h4>Asynchronisme &amp; Sockets</h4>
        <p>
          Maîtrise des boucles d'événements (asyncio, Node.js), sockets POSIX
          non-bloquants et streaming de données chunked haute vitesse.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pillar-item pillar-purple">
      <div class="pillar-icon">
        <i class="fas fa-shield-halved" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-content">
        <h4>Security by Design (AppSec)</h4>
        <p>
          Défense en profondeur, prévention active de l'OWASP Top 10, requêtes
          SQL préparées, tokens éphémères et isolation des processus.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pillar-item pillar-emerald">
      <div class="pillar-icon">
        <i class="fas fa-microchip" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-content">
        <h4>Efficacité &amp; Systèmes Linux</h4>
        <p>
          Structures de données à complexité minimale O(1) en C, gestion fine de
          la mémoire et diagnostic réseau bas niveau sous Linux.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pillar-item pillar-cyan">
      <div class="pillar-icon">
        <i class="fas fa-cubes" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-content">
        <h4>Modularité &amp; Couplage Faible</h4>
        <p>
          Conception d'APIs REST déterministes, séparation des couches métier et
          orchestration de pipelines multimédia résilients.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .engineering-pillars {
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .pillars-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .pillars-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .pillar-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .pillar-icon {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  /* Pillar Chromatic Personalities */
  .pillar-amber .pillar-icon {
    background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.3);
    color: #fbbf24;
  }
  .pillar-amber:hover {
    border-color: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.35);
    background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.03);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -4px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.12);
  }

  .pillar-purple .pillar-icon {
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
    color: #c084fc;
  }
  .pillar-purple:hover {
    border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35);
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.03);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -4px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12);
  }

  .pillar-emerald .pillar-icon {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
    color: #34d399;
  }
  .pillar-emerald:hover {
    border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.03);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -4px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);
  }

  .pillar-cyan .pillar-icon {
    background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
    color: #22d3ee;
  }
  .pillar-cyan:hover {
    border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.35);
    background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.03);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -4px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.12);
  }

  .pillar-content h4 {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #f4f4f5;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .pillar-content p {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pillars-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
